# Parameter file for input to Calc_Lhd_Tool.py
# Contains which combinations of statistics you want to run the analysis with
# where the inventory of stats is specified in the inputted stats paramfile.

# --------------------------------------------------------------------- GENERAL ANALYSIS ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
